nt and visually seamless.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the COB MicroLED 1.2mm suitable for outdoor installations?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This model is optimized for indoor environments such as corporate video walls and meeting rooms due to its brightness level of 1,200 nits. For outdoor use, higher brightness models with environmental protection are recommended.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and support options are available for this display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers standard warranty packages that cover manufacturing defects and performance guarantees. Additionally, dedicated support is provided for installation and maintenance to ensure long-term reliable operation.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the COB MicroLED 1.2mm display handle 8K resolution content?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it is 8K-capable with a high refresh rate of 3,840Hz, ensuring smooth, detailed video playback perfect for high-resolution corporate presentations and visual content.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the typical installation requirements for this display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The lightweight 7 kg panels with large 14.5-inch modules simplify handling and installation. Its modular design facilitates seamless assembly ideal for large-scale corporate video walls.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this product help in energy savings?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The COB MicroLED technology consumes 40% less power compared to traditional SMD LEDs, reducing operational costs and environmental impact without compromising brightness or image quality.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is this display suitable for corporate meeting rooms?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, with its excellent color accuracy, high contrast ratio of 10,000:1, and minimal seam visibility, it enhances video conferencing and presentation visuals for professional meeting environments.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"COB MicroLED 1.2mm\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-cob125\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>COB MicroLED 1.2mm</h1><p>Get sharp, vibrant visuals with the COB MicroLED 1.2mm display from Brightluxx Dubai. Ideal for indoor LED screens in UAE. Request a quote now!</p><p><strong>The sweet spot: 8K-ready COB at scale.</strong></p><p>8K-capable COB display with LP-grade brightness and 40% lower power consumption than traditional SMD. Large-format 14.5-inch modules reduce seams by 50%, ideal for corporate video walls and meeting rooms.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the COB MicroLED 1.2mm?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 1.25mm, providing ultra-fine pixel density ideal for 8K resolution displays with crisp, sharp imagery.</p><h3>How does COB MicroLED technology compare to traditional SMD LEDs?</h3><p>COB MicroLED uses flip-chip technology resulting in 40% lower power consumption, 50% seam reduction, and higher brightness compared to traditional SMD LED solutions, making it more efficient and visually seamless.</p><h3>Is the COB MicroLED 1.2mm suitable for outdoor installations?</h3><p>This model is optimized for indoor environments such as corporate video walls and meeting rooms due to its brightness level of 1,200 nits. For outdoor use, higher brightness models with environmental protection are recommended.</p><h3>What warranty and support options are available for this display?</h3><p>Brightluxx offers standard warranty packages that cover manufacturing defects and performance guarantees. Additionally, dedicated support is provided for installation and maintenance to ensure long-term reliable operation.</p></div></m