003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eGet sharp, vibrant visuals with the COB MicroLED 1.2mm display from Brightluxx Dubai. Ideal for indoor LED screens in UAE. Request a quote now!\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eThe sweet spot: 8K-ready COB at scale.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e8K-capable COB display with LP-grade brightness and 40% lower power consumption than traditional SMD. Large-format 14.5-inch modules reduce seams by 50%, ideal for corporate video walls and meeting rooms.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is the pixel pitch of the COB MicroLED 1.2mm?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe pixel pitch is 1.25mm, providing ultra-fine pixel density ideal for 8K resolution displays with crisp, sharp imagery.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow does COB MicroLED technology compare to traditional SMD LEDs?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eCOB MicroLED uses flip-chip technology resulting in 40% lower power consumption, 50% seam reduction, and higher brightness compared to traditional SMD LED solutions, making it more efficient and visually seamless.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eIs the COB MicroLED 1.2mm suitable for outdoor installations?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis model is optimized for indoor environments such as corporate video walls and meeting rooms due to its brightness level of 1,200 nits. For outdoor use, higher brightness models with environmental protection are recommended.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat warranty and support options are available for this display?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBrightluxx offers standard warranty packages that cover manufacturing defects and performance guarantees. Additionally, dedicated support is provided for installation and maintenance to ensure long-term reliable operation.\\u003c/p\\u003e14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$15\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":