 and meeting rooms.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the COB MicroLED 1.2mm?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 1.25mm, providing ultra-fine pixel density ideal for 8K resolution displays with crisp, sharp imagery.</p><h3>How does COB MicroLED technology compare to traditional SMD LEDs?</h3><p>COB MicroLED uses flip-chip technology resulting in 40% lower power consumption, 50% seam reduction, and higher brightness compared to traditional SMD LED solutions, making it more efficient and visually seamless.</p><h3>Is the COB MicroLED 1.2mm suitable for outdoor installations?</h3><p>This model is optimized for indoor environments such as corporate video walls and meeting rooms due to its brightness level of 1,200 nits. For outdoor use, higher brightness models with environmental protection are recommended.</p><h3>What warranty and support options are available for this display?</h3><p>Brightluxx offers standard warranty packages that cover manufacturing defects and performance guarantees. Additionally, dedicated support is provided for installation and maintenance to ensure long-term reliable operation.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"COB MicroLED 1.2mm | Superior LED Display Dubai UAE | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Get sharp, vibrant visuals with the COB MicroLED 1.2mm display from Brightluxx Dubai. Ideal for indoor LED screens in UAE. Request a quote now!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-cob125\"}]]\n","/$c$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:T596,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Product\", \"name\": \"COB MicroLED 1.2mm\", \"description\": \"8K-capable COB display with LP-grade brightness